# Normalise text files to LF in the repository and in every working copy
# (identical files on Windows, Linux and macOS).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Split / index files are stored byte-for-byte: their SHA-256 is recorded in
# split_meta.json and must stay identical after any clone or checkout.
ai-engine/datasets/splits/*.csv -text
ai-engine/datasets/splits/*.json -text

# Binary assets
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pt binary
